@host = http://localhost:5080

### REG-CORS-01: дозволений origin, очікуємо Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:4173
GET {{host}}/health
Origin: http://localhost:4173

### REG-CORS-01: недозволений origin, Access-Control-Allow-Origin відсутній, статус усе одно 200
GET {{host}}/health
Origin: http://localhost:4174

### Preflight з дозволеного origin: 204 і три Access-Control-Allow-*
OPTIONS {{host}}/health
Origin: http://localhost:4173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: x-lab-cors-probe

### Preflight з недозволеного origin: 204 без Access-Control-*
OPTIONS {{host}}/health
Origin: http://localhost:4174
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: x-lab-cors-probe

### Direct HTTP без cookie: CORS не діє, працює authentication (401)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Origin: http://localhost:4174
